  "provenance": "Legacy Houses.json (AGPL-3.0 reference only; SHA256 854b2d3f009b916a928f66d57a42e2bf685dcc853e898d149580eefd26196d3c) supplies provisional spawn and six-float bounds. Scene choices are R matches from client IconId asset names to community-manifest hsg_emptylot names, plus property 25 (Wilds Condo) whose icon names the client-manifest scene hsg_hum_condo_w_lot; no client property-to-scene map exists. No Legacy source code copied.",
